Hasho Canvas — account deletion

To request deletion of the account linked to Hasho Canvas and its associated data, email yusha@yusha.ai with the subject “Delete my Hasho Canvas account”. Send the request from the email address associated with the account so we can verify it. Do not send your password or payment card details.

You can also request deletion in the app by opening Settings, choosing Contact Us for Help, and submitting the same request with your account email address.

After verifying and processing the request, we delete the account and its linked account data, including linked subscription-verification records, from the active service. These records include the account email and identifiers, hashed purchase and installation references, subscription status and expiry. Existing backup copies, if any, may remain until their normal backup retention period expires. Google Play maintains its own payment and transaction records under Google's policies.

This account may also be used with other Yusha services, including the desktop launcher; deleting it can affect access to those services. Projects stored on your device are not deleted by an account deletion request. Deleting the account does not cancel a Google Play subscription. To stop future subscription charges, cancel the subscription in Google Play.
